    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 170,
        "text": "Hi, everyone. Thanks for coming to the community garden meeting. I'm Mia, the garden coordinator. Today we need to talk about the new garden rules and some problems.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "cdab74fbe611a3f9029a6759ec8f4917c5b15cf4c046c7c808e7f28f6cdffae7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 177,
        "sourceEnd": 248,
        "text": "Hi, Mia. I'm Tom. I have a small plot here. Can I ask a question first?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "40f38b72f354a650c1f28875adb0613d5e708f37beecd4b75fddc79ec768c920",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 255,
        "sourceEnd": 270,
        "text": "Sure, go ahead.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "4373f72939334435385bb4fa0955e3d659bf3e28caa518fbfae813139a74f35b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 277,
        "sourceEnd": 334,
        "text": "Why do we need new rules? The old rules were fine for me.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f1db390d0e7813899aeb6423418288d1b5c3da18dd775ffe58e4cbdf582d1165",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 341,
        "sourceEnd": 493,
        "text": "Good question. We need new rules because more people want to join the garden. If we don't have clear rules, there will be problems with water and tools.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "8bbb1fea6172d8576df9e39ff384c035d5b5fb7139c3df08743a8c4808129396",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 500,
        "sourceEnd": 536,
        "text": "I see. So what are the main changes?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "bbf0fe7b8ccba2892ccc8ef97aa9f686e6a367327dcebe8e085756fdf942901e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 543,
        "sourceEnd": 711,
        "text": "First, if you want to use the water tap, you must write your name on the list. Second, please don't take tools home. If you take a tool home, other people can't use it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "5a4c36fe6156ea681fdba97a998a3de8cbe14798220f866f8e4970b60d93d1a5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 718,
        "sourceEnd": 798,
        "text": "OK. And what about the compost? I saw some plastic in the compost bin last week.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "a0e2cb5b57731b8ecfdafef9581f945c26c1aafeabcc0215d92955bd1d246698",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 805,
        "sourceEnd": 955,
        "text": "Yes, that's a problem. If people put plastic in the compost, the compost will be bad. So please only put fruit and vegetable waste in the compost bin.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "4daff47a880010be3b0d45c5b8aa87e4c768d25724974163f00cf3212d023ac9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 962,
        "sourceEnd": 1052,
        "text": "Right. I'll tell my neighbours. Also, I noticed the gate is often open. Is that a problem?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "4c033cc3100f639c107b76fe4ac2255cb77c1a98da488c7825dbcb88e70c06b0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1059,
        "sourceEnd": 1176,
        "text": "Yes, it is. If the gate is open, animals can come in and eat the vegetables. So please close the gate when you leave.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "b2c82ad30d2689ca69aeda5ee9bf8fc10208368a36832e5a87731fef358e4a03",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1183,
        "sourceEnd": 1256,
        "text": "OK, I'll close it. One more thing: can I bring my children to the garden?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "2292594726c3e9505693d9ba92d7e727770c3ad993ded26a6cab36e8e57474bf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1263,
        "sourceEnd": 1371,
        "text": "Yes, you can, but you should watch them carefully. If children play near the water tap, it can be dangerous.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "bd1edf3f64fe54f7263a7adf338fdc2989f9a84a1f1920e586bd851f65d0842f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1378,
        "sourceEnd": 1419,
        "text": "Understood. And when is the next meeting?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "39f9621f7cf5ececb8a4e2f522c7daf54ef42eedbe395a95a3f4fe70b60c2497",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1426,
        "sourceEnd": 1543,
        "text": "The next meeting is on Saturday, 15th May, at 10 a.m. in the garden. If it rains, we will meet in the community hall.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "e29c45a9734dd71c3817744e5a4ac7c5bedbfbc4c5ef270d9e94b6ebecc67d1e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1550,
        "sourceEnd": 1584,
        "text": "Great. Thanks, Mia. I'll be there.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "e50e2dd211516cf39ada0d5f301c761afcdbf4ced3255f90b68a6c0e50f1a57f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1591,
        "sourceEnd": 1617,
        "text": "Thanks, Tom. See you then.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "e00779c0b48dfff7e2b09a752f1dedd9d20c0cfaf7392fde7beea9d5416b7d86",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
